pertise and experience with thestudents, and invigorated them to widen their perspectives for new ways of seeing. FHS PhD student Jiaheng LI, who is the alumnus of Nanchang University, shared his academic path with the students, and introduced the doctoral study of FHS. He encouraged the students to quench curiosity for truth through research, not to underestimate their abilities and dare to jump out of the comfort zone, where the students can find new opportunities.</span></span><span><span>rof. Wang, as a bachelor graduate of Nanchang Uniersity, shared his expertise and experience with thestudents, and invigorated them to widen their perspectives for new ways of seeing. FHS PhD student Jiaheng LI, who is the alumnus of Nanchang University, shared his academic path with the students, and introduced the doctoral study of FHS. He encouraged the students to quench curiosity for truth through research, not to underestimate their abilities and dare to jump out of the comfort zone, where the students can find new opportunities.</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><strong><span>活動日期</span></strong></span><span><strong><span> </span></strong><span> </span></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>2026年7月27日至30日</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><strong><span>舉辦</span></strong></span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span><span><strong><span>單位</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>澳門大學</span></span><span><span>健康科學學院</span></span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span><strong><span>授課語言</span></strong></span></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><strong><span>英語及普通話</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>活動日程</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"0919.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mDLZpMr9N4rjA6w1A7rZPRf9990ECXum5FRmiaaaqnQia8j9ibet9oKuK85gw7v4Qs6Cs8l6sXfLia9kqicZS9MZZZx9ODQEuFISa0jB0Kdy4sgk/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"0919.jpg\"/></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/7QRTvkK2qC6D2OhibHUMz1XiaC7v0RcUA1thKEXck4AzcEnKnOXEHJibw1OEpzrL0n2O4FNrfgNaAZRcDyzDkKqiaw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>報名需知</span></strong></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><span><span><span>報名條件：</span></span><span></span></span></p><section><ul><li><p><span><span>有意報讀澳大健康科學學院博士生課程的內地高校三年級（四年制課程）、四年級（五年制課程）的本科生、碩士研究生或已獲得碩士或學士學位的畢業生</span></span></p></li></ul></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>優先錄取條件：</span></span></p><section><ul><li><p><span><span>就讀於或已完成生物學、醫學、健康科學、生物醫學工程、公共衛生、生物資訊學、生物統計學或計算機科學相關學士或碩士學位等相關專業</span></span></p></li></ul></section><section><ul><li><p><span><span>成績平均 80分以上、或班級排名前30%、或GPA ≥ 3 (4分制)</span></span></p></li></ul></section><section><ul><li><p><span><span>英語能力證明：</span></span></p></li><li><section><ul><li><p><span><span>托福（TOEFL）書面考試550分／網上考試80分或以上</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>雅思考試（IELTS）總成績6分或以上，且各單項成績不低於5.5分</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>國家大學英語六級考試（CET6）成績430分或以上</span></span></p></li></ul></section></li></ul></section><section><ul><li><p><span><span>來自國際知名院校或「雙一流」建設高校的優秀學生</span></span></p></li></ul></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>報名文件：</span></span></p><section><ul><li><p><span><span>有效內地居民身份證副本</span></span></p></li></ul></section><section><ul><li><p><span><span>內地高校三年級（四年制課程）、四年級（五年制課程）的本科生、碩士研究生須提交最近期的成績單</span></span></p></li></ul></section><section><ul><li><p><span><span>持有學士或碩士學位的申請者須提交學位證書及成績單</span></span></p></li></ul></section><section><ul><li><p><span><span>個人履歷</span></span></p></li></ul></section><section><ul><li><p><span><span>英語能力證明（如適用）</span></span></p></li></ul></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>報名方法：</span></span></p><p><span><span>只接受網上報名。4月12日或之前，掃瞄報名二維碼進行報名。報名時須上傳上述的報名文件。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>報名截止：</span></span><strong><span><span>2026年4月12日23:59</span></span></strong><span><span> (入選學生將在2026年6月1日或之前收到通知)</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>免費項目 (由澳大健康科學學院提供)：</span></span></p><section><ul><li><p><span><span>夏令營期間在澳大之住宿費</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>三天早餐</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>歡迎晚宴</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>結業午宴</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>文化活動</span></span></p></li></ul></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>自費項目：</span></span></p><section><ul><li><p><span><span>進出澳門的有效旅遊證件、簽證費用及其他相關費用 (詳情請參閱澳門治安警察局出入境管制廳的入境須知)</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>往返澳門的交通安排及其相關費用</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>前往及離開澳門大學的交通安排及其相關費用</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>外遊保險費用</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>除上述項目外，所有未提及的費用均屬自費項目</span></span></p></li></ul></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>注意事項</span></span></strong><strong><span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1) 本活動除自費項目外，不會額外收取任何費用，也沒有透過任何機構/中介招生，請同學小心詐騙;</span><span><br/></span><span> 2) 本活動僅接受由官方提供的電子系統報名，其他方式提交的申請將不獲考慮;</span><span><br/></span><span> 3) 如有學生重覆提交申請多於一次，只考慮最後提交的版本;</span><span><br/></span><span> 4) 學院僅接受當下提交的內容，不接受補交或任何修改，請學生謹慎上傳內容;</span><span><br/></span><span> 5) 學院將透過在官網公佈錄取結果，同時會發電子郵件通知獲選及後補學生，請留意信箱及保持信箱暢通;</span><span><br/></span><span> 6) 如因資料填寫錯誤或個人信箱無效導致錯過任何重要資訊，相關責任由學生自行承擔;</span><span><br/></span><span> 7) 學生收到錄取通知後，須在限期前上傳有效赴澳門簽證並提供赴澳旅遊保險，以示確認，否則當作放棄;</span><span><br/></span><span> 8) 一旦入選學生確認參與活動後，不得隨意退出計畫。任何缺乏正當及充分理由退出計畫的情況將會被記錄在案，將影響學生將來申請澳門大學的課程或其他交流活動。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>澳大健康科學學院保留最終解釋權並有權修改上述之細則及決定權。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"registry.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/mDLZpMr9N4rHIJz0zbiawlWS4Ox1NAy55DiazM3f7tLPNFmJ3vibSWCnliadpF3kK8obp2j25G4rh8Qedbm21tuuoVFI7ZL1j1vJkyVG7S4zEE0/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"MSBS_regQR.png\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>有興趣可報名參加!</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Registration Link</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><sectio